      "label": "hateful emotion",
      "description": "The emotion expressed is hatred, directed toward Muslims, as conveyed by the text 'all races unite against islam!'. This is a hateful message that promotes division and hostility toward a specific religious group, leveraging the visual metaphor of unity to mask its divisive intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_e6c3c2a6"
      },
